<title>USA: Sioux Falls feeder cattle market not tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls feeder cattle market not tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were not tested, USDA said. Rain, snow, and blizzard conditions over the weekend hampered movement of cattle.</p>
<p>Receipts: This Week 40  Last Week 463  Last Year 836</p>
